  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "evt",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 292,
   "width": 1360,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "⚠ WHAT JUST HAPPENED — checked live today: the last device sync was 2026-07-22 04:48 UTC.\nThat is 45.8 HOURS AGO, and the system said nothing. The bell only announces activity — it has no concept of silence.\n4 off-plan alerts also sit unseen in the feed. The cut-off / missing-sync alert was consciously skipped back in July.",
   "originalText": "⚠ WHAT JUST HAPPENED — checked live today: the last device sync was 2026-07-22 04:48 UTC.\nThat is 45.8 HOURS AGO, and the system said nothing. The bell only announces activity — it has no concept of silence.\n4 off-plan alerts also sit unseen in the feed. The cut-off / missing-sync alert was consciously skipped back in July.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "strokeColor": "#7f1d1d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
