  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "oab",
   "x": 74,
   "y": 490,
   "width": 430,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "The feed gains a \"no sync in N hours\" alert, so the\ndashboard turns red on silence instead of looking calm.\n\n  🔔 No sync from se-003 in 26 h\n  🔔 Fleet silent since 22 Jul 04:48 (45 h)\n\n✓ closes the exact gap that just bit\n✓ small: one query + one alert type, in the\n   generator that already exists\n✓ per-enumerator or fleet-wide, your call\n✗ still only visible in the browser tab",
   "originalText": "The feed gains a \"no sync in N hours\" alert, so the\ndashboard turns red on silence instead of looking calm.\n\n  🔔 No sync from se-003 in 26 h\n  🔔 Fleet silent since 22 Jul 04:48 (45 h)\n\n✓ closes the exact gap that just bit\n✓ small: one query + one alert type, in the\n   generator that already exists\n✓ per-enumerator or fleet-wide, your call\n✗ still only visible in the browser tab",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
