  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "obb",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 490,
   "width": 430,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "The box posts to Slack itself — nobody needs the\ndashboard open. Same pattern as the F2 UAT bot.\n\n  #capi-scrum  ⚠️ Off-plan case · F3 · se-005\n  #capi-scrum  🔕 No syncs in 24 h\n  09:00 digest: 12 new cases, 3 enumerators\n\n✓ reaches people on their phones, all day\n✓ a permanent record in-channel\n✗ needs a webhook URL (SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL is\n   empty; e-mail relay is blocked on this box)\n✗ new failure mode: alert fatigue if too chatty",
   "originalText": "The box posts to Slack itself — nobody needs the\ndashboard open. Same pattern as the F2 UAT bot.\n\n  #capi-scrum  ⚠️ Off-plan case · F3 · se-005\n  #capi-scrum  🔕 No syncs in 24 h\n  09:00 digest: 12 new cases, 3 enumerators\n\n✓ reaches people on their phones, all day\n✓ a permanent record in-channel\n✗ needs a webhook URL (SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL is\n   empty; e-mail relay is blocked on this box)\n✗ new failure mode: alert fatigue if too chatty",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
