   "width": 430,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "Keep the browser-only model, make it nicer:\nmark-all-read, filter by enumerator, sound,\nnotify on edited-only syncs, richer alert copy.\n\n✓ cheapest; no new moving parts\n✓ helps whoever DOES watch the dashboard\n✗ does not fix the thing that just failed —\n   45 h of silence would still pass unnoticed\n✗ polishing a channel nobody is guaranteed\n   to be looking at",
   "originalText": "Keep the browser-only model, make it nicer:\nmark-all-read, filter by enumerator, sound,\nnotify on edited-only syncs, richer alert copy.\n\n✓ cheapest; no new moving parts\n✓ helps whoever DOES watch the dashboard\n✗ does not fix the thing that just failed —\n   45 h of silence would still pass unnoticed\n✗ polishing a channel nobody is guaranteed\n   to be looking at",
