  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "rct",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 740,
   "width": 1360,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "RECOMMEND A + B — one build, not two. Add the silence alert to the feed generator (A), then let that same\ngenerator post alerts to Slack (B), so silence and off-plan cases reach a phone instead of an unopened tab.\nC is a nice-to-have afterwards. B needs one thing from you: a Slack webhook URL for the channel you want.",
   "originalText": "RECOMMEND A + B — one build, not two. Add the silence alert to the feed generator (A), then let that same\ngenerator post alerts to Slack (B), so silence and off-plan cases reach a phone instead of an unopened tab.\nC is a nice-to-have afterwards. B needs one thing from you: a Slack webhook URL for the channel you want.",
